@atrupar Vance says Paxton is direct. 

So is diarrhea. 

Neither belongs in public office.

Vice President JD Vance packed a standing-room-only crowd at Tyler Pounds Regional Airport, delivering a full-throated endorsement of Senate nominee Ken Paxton while announcing a Defense Production Act expansion of the local Delek refinery

@JDVance: “Today, I am pleased to announce that the Trump administration, working with the refinery at Delek, has used the Defense Production Act, and we are going to expand the refinery right here in Tyler, Texas.”

